match get_flag("SocialLink/Maple"):
	when 0:
		=> rank1_prepare
=> END

~ rank1_prepare
Maple.Neutral: Hello mira
if confirm_time_passage("Talk to Maple" ,"I can get to know Maple a bit better. This might also allow me make better force orbs."):
	Maple.Neutral: Let's go then
	$>> run_cue("sl_maple", "rank1")
else:
	Maple.Neutral: Okay...
=> END

~ rank1
$> travel_to("Pyrson", Vector2(362, 778), 0, "wait")
$> no_player()
$> spawn("Mira:MiraOVBag", Vector2(300, 778), Direction.RIGHT)
$> spawn("Maple", Vector2(350, 778), Direction.LEFT)
$> zoom(5)
$>> Transition.unwipe()
$> wait(1)
$> Textbox.open("sl_maple", "rank1_1")
$> progress_by_time(1)
$>> time_transition()
=> END

~ rank1_1
Pretend a conversation is happening
Ok now time moves forward
=> END
